{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=720 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.mp4?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game about a troubled mind succumbing to the calls of the void.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwell is a terrifying, psychological survival horror inspired by Freud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak among the whispers, fight monsters from the past, solve puzzles that reopen old wounds, and explore the corridors of your own mind\u2014before what you repress becomes your only guide down the well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/d851f17a1d7902e5428f45b84aaa8243.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/d851f17a1d7902e5428f45b84aaa8243.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/d851f17a1d7902e5428f45b84aaa8243.mp4?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=620 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek the way down.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=620 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the twisted environment to your advantage. Seek refuge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a simple stone can save your life. Throw it to redirect unwanted interest of other well dwellers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when cornered... fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths to find clues, overcome obstacles and solve puzzles to unravel the mysteries of the well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=620 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwell</strong> is an survival horror game with a narrative inspired by the psychological theory of personality by Sigmund Freud and The Map Of Consciousness by David R. Hawkins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.poster.avif?t=1759402317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.webm?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.mp4?t=1759402317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse